---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import styles from '../styles/legal.module.css';
---

<Layout
  title="About WitrQuran"
  description="WitrQuran was created with one simple idea: Listening to the Quran should be simple peaceful and uninterrupted."
>
  <div class={styles.pageContainer}>
    <nav class={styles.breadcrumb} aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>About</span>
    </nav>

    <header class={styles.header}>
      <h1 class={styles.title}>About WitrQuran</h1>
    </header>

    <div class={styles.content}>
      <p>WitrQuran was created with one simple idea</p>

      <p><strong>Listening to the Quran should be simple peaceful and uninterrupted</strong></p>

      <p>The Quran is the Book of Almighty Allah SWT</p>

      <p>We did not create it and we do not claim any ownership over it</p>

      <p>Our role is simply to make listening to the Quran easier and more accessible for everyone by the will of Allah SWT</p>

      <h2>Why We Built WitrQuran</h2>

      <p>We wanted to create a Quran listening experience without unnecessary complexity distractions or an overloaded interface</p>

      <p>Open WitrQuran<br />
      Choose a Surah<br />
      Press play<br />
      Listen</p>

      <p>That is it</p>

      <p>No account<br />
      No complicated setup<br />
      No unnecessary features<br />
      No distracting advertisements</p>

      <p>Just a simple place to listen to the Quran</p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>

      <p>Our mission is simple</p>

      <p><strong>We give 100% free and charge no money because we believe the Holy Quran is a gift of God to all humanity, so we cannot charge because we do not feel we have that right or ability to charge money for this.</strong></p>

      <p>To provide an ad free, pure Quran listening experience that is accessible to everyone across the globe without paywalls or subscriptions.</p>

      <p>WitrQuran is completely free to use and does not require registration.</p>

      <h2>Built With Simplicity</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is intentionally simple</p>

      <p>The platform is designed to load quickly and provide a clean listening experience across mobile tablet and desktop</p>

      <p>We are not trying to make the Quran experience complicated</p>

      <p>We are trying to remove what does not need to be there</p>

      <h2>Open Source</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran is open source</p>

      <p>The source code is publicly available on GitHub and released under the MIT License</p>

      <p>Anyone can inspect the code contribute improvements report issues or help improve the project</p>

      <p><a href="https://github.com/witrfaruk/WitrQuran" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>View WitrQuran on GitHub</strong></a></p>

      <h2>A Note From The Founder</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran was created by <strong>Md Faruk Abdulla</strong></p>

      <p>The Quran belongs to Almighty Allah SWT</p>

      <p>Faruk simply built WitrQuran as a tool to make listening to the Quran simpler for everyone</p>

      <p>Whatever benefit comes from this project is only by the will and permission of Allah SWT</p>

      <p><strong>May Allah SWT make the Quran a source of guidance peace and benefit for everyone who listens to it</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
